From 80b23916d0f850c58141ef683123ef0e605febb1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: gr8-ml4 <benjamin.j.millar@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 21:02:52 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] ML4: S2 serve at --mtp 0 with the DSpark drafter; CP prefill
 staging for KV-sharing layers

- options.rs: ML4 --serve takes --mtp 0 with --dflash-manifest (and refuses --mtp N)
- native.cuh / g6m4.cu / s2.cuh: no MTP draft Model at K = 0 (s2_models, s2_most, s2_place; capture_all K >= 0)
- planner.rs: round_dfl skips the MTP first-form pass at K = 0
- rank.cuh: the ML4 attention block compacts the S2 output (S2Model::cat) under S2
- prefill.cuh: layer 35 staged latent -> a stash the KV-sharing layers read; their copy-back is index keys only

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
